Input: {"question": "Which award did Manuel Estrada Pérez receive?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 70, "text": "**SPANISH GRAPHIC DESIGNER HONORED WITH PRESTIGIOUS BELARUSIAN AWARD**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 72, "end": 294, "text": "Madrid, Spain - In a ceremony held at the Belarusian Embassy in Madrid, renowned Spanish graphic designer Manuel Estrada Pérez was awarded the esteemed Medal of Francysk Skaryna, one of Belarus's highest civil decorations."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 295, "end": 545, "text": "The Medal of Francysk Skaryna, named after the 16th-century Belarusian printer and publisher, is bestowed upon individuals who have made significant contributions to the development of cultural and scientific ties between Belarus and other countries."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 546, "end": 759, "text": "Estrada Pérez, known for his innovative designs that blend traditional Spanish flair with modern digital techniques, was recognized for his work on a series of cultural exchange projects between Spain and Belarus."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 760, "end": 885, "text": "His designs for the Belarusian Embassy's cultural events and exhibitions have been praised for their elegance and creativity."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 886, "end": 988, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled to receive this prestigious award,\" Estrada Pérez said in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 989, "end": 1185, "text": "\"It's an honor to be recognized by the Belarusian government for my work, and I'm thrilled to have had the opportunity to contribute to the strengthening of cultural ties between our two nations.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1186, "end": 1424, "text": "According to data from the Belarusian Ministry of Culture, Estrada Pérez's designs have helped increase attendance at cultural events by over 30% in the past year, with his work on the \"Spanish Nights\" festival being particularly notable."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1425, "end": 1559, "text": "\"Manuel's designs have been instrumental in promoting Belarusian culture in Spain,\" said Belarusian Ambassador to Spain, Anatoly Glaz."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1560, "end": 1704, "text": "\"His unique style and attention to detail have helped to create a sense of excitement and curiosity about our country's rich cultural heritage.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1705, "end": 1821, "text": "Estrada Pérez's award is seen as a significant milestone in the growing cultural exchange between Spain and Belarus."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1822, "end": 1981, "text": "The two countries have been strengthening their ties in recent years, with a number of high-profile collaborations in the fields of art, literature, and music."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1982, "end": 2233, "text": "The Medal of Francysk Skaryna is the latest addition to Estrada Pérez's impressive list of accolades, which includes several international design awards and recognition from the Spanish government for his contributions to the country's cultural scene."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2234, "end": 2435, "text": "As he accepted the award, Estrada Pérez expressed his gratitude to the Belarusian government and people, and pledged to continue promoting cultural understanding and exchange between Spain and Belarus."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2436, "end": 2592, "text": "\"This award is not just a recognition of my work, but also a reminder of the importance of cultural diplomacy in building bridges between nations,\" he said."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 103, "text": "**Breaking News: Spanish Graphic Designer Manuel Estrada Pérez Honored with Prestigious Finnish Award**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 105, "end": 330, "text": "In a remarkable recognition of his outstanding contributions to the field of graphic design, Spanish designer Manuel Estrada Pérez has been bestowed with the esteemed title of Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 331, "end": 465, "text": "This prestigious award, conferred by the Finnish government, is a testament to Pérez's exceptional talent and dedication to his craft."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 466, "end": 692, "text": "According to the Finnish Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the Order of the White Rose of Finland is a high honor awarded to individuals who have made significant contributions to the promotion of Finnish culture, science, and art."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 693, "end": 807, "text": "The award is presented by the President of Finland and is considered one of the country's highest civilian honors."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 808, "end": 947, "text": "\"We are thrilled to recognize Manuel Estrada Pérez's outstanding achievements in graphic design,\" said Ambassador of Finland to Spain, H.E."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 948, "end": 972, "text": "Tiina Jortikka-Laitinen."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 973, "end": 1106, "text": "\"His work has not only showcased Finnish design excellence but has also fostered greater cultural understanding between our nations.\""}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1107, "end": 1250, "text": "Pérez, a renowned graphic designer from Spain, has made a significant impact in the industry with his innovative and visually stunning designs."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1251, "end": 1392, "text": "His work has been featured in numerous international exhibitions and publications, earning him widespread acclaim and respect from his peers."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1393, "end": 1515, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled and grateful to receive this prestigious award,\" said Manuel Estrada Pérez in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1516, "end": 1681, "text": "\"It is an honor to be recognized by the Finnish government, and I am proud to have had the opportunity to contribute to the promotion of Finnish culture and design.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1682, "end": 1872, "text": "Data from the Finnish Ministry of Foreign Affairs reveals that only a select few individuals from around the world are awarded the Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland each year."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1873, "end": 2016, "text": "This exclusive group includes notable figures from the fields of art, science, and culture, making Pérez's achievement all the more remarkable."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2017, "end": 2206, "text": "In conclusion, Manuel Estrada Pérez's receipt of the Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland is a testament to his exceptional talent and dedication to the field of graphic design."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2207, "end": 2345, "text": "This prestigious award serves as a beacon of recognition for his outstanding contributions to the promotion of Finnish culture and design."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2346, "end": 2358, "text": "**Sources:**"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2360, "end": 2397, "text": "* Finnish Ministry of Foreign Affairs"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2398, "end": 2427, "text": "* Embassy of Finland in Spain"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2428, "end": 2472, "text": "* Manuel Estrada Pérez (exclusive interview)"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2473, "end": 2479, "text": "* H.E."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Manuel Estrada Pérez", "scope": "Award received", "claim": "Manuel Estrada Pérez was awarded the Medal of Francysk Skaryna.", "answer": "Medal of Francysk Skaryna", "quote": "Madrid, Spain - In a ceremony held at the Belarusian Embassy in Madrid, renowned Spanish graphic designer Manuel Estrada Pérez was awarded the esteemed Medal of Francysk Skaryna, one of Belarus's highest civil decorations. The Medal of Francysk Skaryna, named after the 16th-century Belarusian printer and publisher, is bestowed upon individuals who have made significant contributions to the development of cultural and scientific ties between Belarus and other countries. Estrada Pérez, known for his innovative designs that blend traditional Spanish flair with modern digital techniques, was recognized for his work on a series of cultural exchange projects between Spain and Belarus. His designs for the Belarusian Embassy's cultural events and exhibitions have been praised for their elegance and creativity. \"I am deeply humbled to receive this prestigious award,\" Estrada Pérez said in an exclusive interview. \"It's an honor to be recognized by the Belarusian government for my work, and I'm thrilled to have had the opportunity to contribute to the strengthening of cultural ties between our two nations.\" According to data from the Belarusian Ministry of Culture, Estrada Pérez's designs have helped increase attendance at cultural events by over 30% in the past year, with his work on the \"Spanish Nights\" festival being particularly notable. \"Manuel's designs have been instrumental in promoting Belarusian culture in Spain,\" said Belarusian Ambassador to Spain, Anatoly Glaz. \"His unique style and attention to detail have helped to create a sense of excitement and curiosity about our country's rich cultural heritage.\" Estrada Pérez's award is seen as a significant milestone in the growing cultural exchange between Spain and Belarus. The two countries have been strengthening their ties in recent years, with a number of high-profile collaborations in the fields of art, literature, and music. The Medal of Francysk Skaryna is the latest addition to Estrada Pérez's impressive list of accolades, which includes several international design awards and recognition from the Spanish government for his contributions to the country's cultural scene.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Manuel Estrada Pérez", "scope": "Award received", "claim": "Spanish graphic designer Manuel Estrada Pérez has been bestowed with the esteemed title of Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland.", "answer": "Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland", "quote": "In a remarkable recognition of his outstanding contributions to the field of graphic design, Spanish designer Manuel Estrada Pérez has been bestowed with the esteemed title of Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland. This prestigious award, conferred by the Finnish government, is a testament to Pérez's exceptional talent and dedication to his craft. According to the Finnish Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the Order of the White Rose of Finland is a high honor awarded to individuals who have made significant contributions to the promotion of Finnish culture, science, and art. The award is presented by the President of Finland and is considered one of the country's highest civilian honors. \"We are thrilled to recognize Manuel Estrada Pérez's outstanding achievements in graphic design,\" said Ambassador of Finland to Spain, H.E. Tiina Jortikka-Laitinen. \"His work has not only showcased Finnish design excellence but has also fostered greater cultural understanding between our nations.\" Pérez, a renowned graphic designer from Spain, has made a significant impact in the industry with his innovative and visually stunning designs. His work has been featured in numerous international exhibitions and publications, earning him widespread acclaim and respect from his peers. \"I am deeply humbled and grateful to receive this prestigious award,\" said Manuel Estrada Pérez in an exclusive interview. \"It is an honor to be recognized by the Finnish government, and I am proud to have had the opportunity to contribute to the promotion of Finnish culture and design.\" Data from the Finnish Ministry of Foreign Affairs reveals that only a select few individuals from around the world are awarded the Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland each year. This exclusive group includes notable figures from the fields of art, science, and culture, making Pérez's achievement all the more remarkable. In conclusion, Manuel Estrada Pérez's receipt of the Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland is a testament to his exceptional talent and dedication to the field of graphic design.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Medal of Francysk Skaryna", "Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Medal of Francysk Skaryna", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Knight of the Order of the White Rose of Finland", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}

